 res/mipmap-xxhdpi/ic_launcher.png       | Bin 0 -> 17283 bytes
 res/mipmap-xxxhdpi/ic_launcher.png      | Bin 0 -> 23838 bytes
 9 files changed, 76 deletions(-)
